[l_english.STATE_LORE_658]
Diamondia is a weird place, where mining new ores is the only goal of these Diamond Dogs. The king or queen here does not come from bloodline, money, or status, but from the ability to find ore veins. They don’t give a damn about how they get the gems, whether they mine themselves, “employ” slaves to mine, or rob... you can even choose to trade with them legally! Although they don’t know where these mined ores end up, as long as there’s money to be made, there’s no need to ask.
Trixie once briefly became the queen of Diamondia, although she deceived these Diamond Dogs — she didn’t have the ability to find ore veins. After losing the ruler who could find ore veins, there was no longer a ruler here, and the Diamond Dogs here freely mined ores under the loose organization of the Mining Association, and the ores here flowed freely to all parts of the world — well, mainly to Las Pegasus. To their north, the two ponies managing Las Pegasus are even less concerned about how those gems are obtained than they are.

[l_simp_chinese.STATE_LORE_658]
宝石王国是一个诡异的地方，在这里，开采新的矿石是这些钻石狗们的唯一目标。这里的国王或者女王并不来自于血统、金钱或者地位，而是来自于寻找矿脉的能力。他们并不在乎获取宝石的手段，自己开采、“雇佣”奴隶开采、抢夺... 你甚至可以选择与他们合法交易！尽管他们也不知道这些开采出来的矿石最后流向哪里，只要有钱赚就没有必要过问。
特丽克西曾经短暂成为了宝石王国的女王，尽管她欺骗了这些钻石狗 —— 她并没有寻找矿脉的能力。在失去能寻找矿脉的统治者后，这里就不再有一个统治者了，这里的钻石狗们在矿业协会的松散组织下自由地开采矿石，这里的矿石也被自由地流向了世界各地 —— 其实主要是流向了洛马基。在他们的北边，管理着洛马基的两只小马比他们更加不关心获取那些宝石的手段。
